<title>HONG KONG: Pansy Ho to head Shun Tak shipping arm.</title>
<headline>Pansy Ho to head Shun Tak shipping arm.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shun Tak Holdings Ltd said on Monday it had named Pansy Ho as executive director of its core shipping business.</p>
<p>Ho, who is currently executive director of the group's corporate affairs and development division, succeeds executive director David Hill, who will retire shortly but remain a director and consultant to the group.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
